# This repo is PUBLIC. It holds the JS modules that get loaded into the Webflow
# site and nothing else — no client copy, no Designer working copies, no audit
# output, no pages scraped from live sites. Everything below stays on disk
# locally and out of the repo. Think hard before un-ignoring any of it.

# Reference material: Figma maps, QA findings, legal copy, SEO backup, audit
# output. See local/README.md. Ignored wholesale, so anything dropped in there
# is safe by default — that's what the folder is for.
local/

# Working copies of the Webflow HTML Embeds. The CSS's real home is the
# Designer; the README in there is the consolidation write-up.
webflow/

# Tool output, recreated on demand
figma-assets/
scratchpad/
test-output/
outputs/
